==Trivia==
*Metal Cyclone existed in the game data for an indeterminate length of time before it was implemented in [[Version 3.0 Update|Version 3.0]], hence why it is the fourth [[:Category:Cyclones|Cyclone]] in the [[Enemy Release Order]] despite being the fifth released, coming after [[Divine Cyclone]], and why [[Oncoming Maelstrom (Expert)|Wrath of Heaven]]'s ID comes before [[Attack on Titanium (Insane)|Sweet Irony]]'s in spite of that.
**Before Metal Cyclone was implemented, it appeared noticeably higher above the ground, floating at the same altitude as the previous Cyclones - as shown in the gallery above.
***The Metal Cyclone in [[The Battle Cats POP!]] still has this appearence.
*Metal Cyclone is the only Cyclone to close its eye when it is knocked back.
*Metal Cyclone has the highest health, shortest range and fastest attack rate of all [[:Category:Metal Enemies|Metal Enemies]].

